# Fixture 5: request/response pairing hazards.
#
# A) answered request.
0   7E0 TX 02 3E 01 00 00 00 00 00
20  7E8 RX 02 7E 01 00 00 00 00 00
#
# B) unanswered request (no response within P2 = 500 ms).
100 7E0 TX 03 22 F1 90 00 00 00 00
#
# C) duplicate request, one response -> 2 session candidates, tentatively newest.
300 7E0 TX 02 3E 00 00 00 00 00 00
320 7E0 TX 02 3E 00 00 00 00 00 00
340 7E8 RX 02 7E 00 00 00 00 00 00
#
# D) stale replayed response: same SID as an old exchange but no open request in window.
1500 7E8 RX 02 7E 01 00 00 00 00 00
#
